{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>廣西南寧市青秀山風景區葉子花園三角梅（亦稱簕杜鵑）進入盛放期，花海如潮，不少遊人紛紛前往賞花打卡。根據中國科學院華南植物園資料，三角梅一般為3朵花成三角形對稱排列，故稱「三角梅」。（中新社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:13:25.573861+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":95,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:13:49.368697+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:07:01.772607+00:00","content_hash":"a29ee9226a81ccc6a75344f73207b23b78746cd4f9248debf7657910424edfbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}